# Phase 5 digest literals, composite version 2, recorded from the UNMODIFIED tree (HEAD before plan 06-05).
# Owning plan 06-05 (task 1, the first commit of the plan; D-16, A-11). These are the historical composite
# version 2 repeatability pins: values the emulator produced before any STIC storage existed. They are NEVER
# evidence of correctness. Plan 06-05 tasks 3 and 4 compare the re-blessed composite-version-3 goldens against
# them: digest.cpu and digest.images must be equal (the STIC storage must not perturb the CPU or the images);
# digest.mem, digest.instance and digest.composite are expected to differ, as is anything derived from them.
# Lines: <name> <hex>; test.stepped.N is domain N (0 = composite, 1..4 = cpu, mem, images, instance) of Content A loaded,
# power-on reset, 100 units through the step seam. Sources: tests/machine/machine_digest.c (md_fresh_composite, md_stepped;
# each confirmed by a passing run of build/dev/tests/ivs_tests_machine --only machine.digest. on the unmodified tree)
# and the committed goldens (read, not recomputed). golden.pkg-consumer.* is data/expected/pkg-consumer.golden: its
# digest.<domain> lines (first replay) and its ctrl.digest.<domain> lines (second replay, equal to the diag-ctrl-psg-pass golden).
